  "fullDescription": "Bring the intensity of the stadium to your screen with the Block Retro Jersey font, a powerful athletic typeface designed for sports branding and fan apparel.\n\nThis jersey font features classic blocky proportions and a distressed “jersey print” texture that mimics the look of vintage collegiate wear. The Block Retro Jersey typeface is the ultimate choice for team logos, varsity jackets, and sports-themed event flyers. With its high-contrast outlines and sturdy verticality, the Block Retro Jersey font ensures your message remains legible even from a distance.\n\nPair this Block Retro Jersey font with bold team colors and numbers to create a professional, “Athletic Dept” aesthetic that honors sports history.",
